{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, run-down shop into the bar of your dreams. Serve amazing drinks, keep your guests happy, and grow your business with smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is the key to attracting customers. Use your initial budget wisely to get basic supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment, develop your style, and make your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb26e0a86919e4221611d2c.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BALANCE IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running a successful pub is about more than just pouring drinks. Manage your stock, control expenses, and respond to customer demands. Make smart investments or risk putting your business in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/e1a06817b2ddbb75b726282d1d222ecb.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AN IMMERSIVE PUB MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its deep management system, evolving gameplay, and realistic pub-building mechanics, <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> offers a truly satisfying adventure. Transform dust into charm and build the pub you\u2019ve always dreamed of become the favorite spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ace613723e55b207079d1da7123e007.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD IT TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no limit to how big you can grow! Build the pub of your dreams, become the neighborhood\u2019s favorite spot, and rise as a star in the world of bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss out on this realistic pub management simulation! Add <i><strong>The Pub Life Simulator</strong></i> to your wishlist now and be among the first to play!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826210?t=1751542776","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/6b0dfb2d5466502c2909e33f36cfc71a52e5b5e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751542776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/71c65494685e285c3114c9b6ef4d79b7ffcafc7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751542776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/71c65494685e285c3114c9b6ef4d79b7ffcafc7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751542776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game offers a virtual pub management experience and includes:\r\n\r\n- Gameplay mechanics involving the sale of alcohol.\r\n\r\n- Scenes that feature alcohol as part of the simulation elements, without promoting its consumption.\r\n\r\nThe game is designed as an entertaining management simulation and does not intend to encourage real-life alcohol use. Players are encouraged to make responsible decisions as a pub owner."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/2de4d6283451133963c4bd525dd57f63.avif?t=1751542776\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>READY TO RUN YOUR OWN PUB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <i>The Pub Life Simulator</i> and turn a small, run-down shop into the bar of your dreams. Serve amazing drinks, keep your guests happy, and grow your business with smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/fdbeadd3a475626206c85d797560d46f.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START FRESH, CLEAN UP, AND OPEN YOUR PUB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first task is to tidy up the place. A clean and welcoming environment is the key to attracting customers. Use your initial budget wisely to get basic supplies and kick things off with a simple menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.poster.avif?t=1751542776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/0ae2e8301f848149fa55f8319b6e9a92.webm?t=1751542776\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPAND YOUR MENU AND MASTER YOUR CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, unlock new ingredients, master recipes, and create drinks your guests will love. Experiment, develop your style, and make your mark on the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/extras/cf9f6e848bb2