he pub of your dreams, become the neighborhood\u2019s favorite spot, and rise as a star in the world of bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t miss out on this realistic pub management simulation! Add <i><strong>The Pub Life Simulator</strong></i> to your wishlist now and be among the first to play!</p>","developers":["Visma Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826210/f2c2966c62bf950f1c71c583c599454f8bc7370a/header.jpg?t=1751542776","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161375,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161375/movie480.mp4?t=1751295110","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161375/movie_max.mp4?t=1751295110"},"name":"Prologue Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161375/1bd59058bd24a383d21781798a73aaf64b90d190/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751295110","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161375/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751295110","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161375/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751295110"}}],"name":"The Pub Life Simulator: Prologue","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</